bd7-8878-0f799e599bc9"><div class="L6-event__meta"><div class="L6-news__footer__meta__info"><strong></strong></div><time data-mod="time-since-published" data-module-launcher-config='{"publishDate": "2026-10-05 20:47:00.000+0200"}'></time><time class="L6-event__meta__date" pubdate datetime="2026-10-05T20:47:00+02:00">05 de octubre de 2026<span>20:47</span></time></div><h2 class="L6-event__title">El pronóstico de Ramoncín sobre el adelanto electoral: &quot;Le va a favorecer al PSOE&quot;</h2><p class="L6-event__text">Ramoncín ha considerado en Más Vale Tarde que la decisión de Pedro Sánchez de adelantar elecciones es buena porque le va a favorecer al PSOE.</p><div class="L6-news__media"><div><div class="video-wrapper"><div><section class="modVideo a3mod_player" data-mod="a3mod_player" data-model="/json/video/7/2026/10/05/6ac3bd7343f52c000793ca05.json" data-main-content="false" data-no-background="true"><video class="video-main lazy" title="El pronóstico de Ramoncín sobre el adelanto electoral: &quot;Le va a favorecer al PSOE&quot;" width="546" height="306" poster="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/69A06100-2B80-48A3-9F44-D893E5627A23/pronostico-ramoncin-adelanto-electoral-favorecer-psoe_163.jpg?crop=1920,1076,x0,y2&width=546&height=306&optimize=low&format=webply" preload="none"><source src="https://dpvclip.lasexta.com/assets15/2026/10/05/D48F413A-7B2F-4406-A4F9-71649293E184/640x360.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><button class="icon link-content" aria-label="Reproducir" data-mod-elem="icon"><div class="wrap-img"></div></button></section></div><picture class="L6-media__picture"><source media="(max-width: 320px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/69A06100-2B80-48A3-9F44-D893E5627A23/pronostico-ramoncin-adelanto-electoral-favorecer-psoe_160.jpg?crop=1920,1080,x0,y0&width=544&height=306&optimize=low&format=webply" width="544" height="306"><source media="(min-width: 394px) and (max-width: 412px)" srcset="htt