84d44b52907.html"><button class="L6-social-share__button L6-social-share__button--mail"><svg width="26" height="27" viewBox="0 0 26 27" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.76 0.860001C19.81 0.860001 25.52 6.56999 25.52 13.62C25.52 20.67 19.81 26.38 12.76 26.38C5.71 26.38 0 20.67 0 13.62C0 6.56999 5.71 0.860001 12.76 0.860001Z" fill="#1D1D1B"></path><path d="M18.71 9.45V11.83L12.76 14.21L6.81 11.83V9.45C6.81 9.12 7.08 8.85001 7.41 8.85001H18.13C18.46 8.85001 18.73 9.12 18.73 9.45H18.71ZM6.81 13.12V17.79C6.81 18.12 7.08 18.39 7.41 18.39H18.13C18.46 18.39 18.73 18.12 18.73 17.79V13.12L12.78 15.5L6.83 13.12H6.81Z" fill="white"></path></svg> <span class="screen-reader-text">Compartir por correo</span></button> </a></li></ul></article><article class="L6-live__event" id="8ad6dfa7-eda0-44d7-907c-65e9f0fbcc3a"><div class="L6-event__meta"><div class="L6-news__footer__meta__info"><strong></strong></div><time data-mod="time-since-published" data-module-launcher-config='{"publishDate": "2026-10-05 15:01:00.000+0200"}'></time><time class="L6-event__meta__date" pubdate datetime="2026-10-05T15:01:00+02:00">05 de octubre de 2026<span>15:01</span></time></div><h2 class="L6-event__title">Baldoví confía en darle la vuelta a las encuestas y asegura que Compromís construirá una candidatura valenciana abierta</h2><p class="L6-event__text"><strong>Joan Baldoví</strong>, síndic de Compromís en Les Corts, reflexiona sobre si el presidente acierta o no al <strong><a title="adelantar las elecciones generales" href="https://www.lasexta.com/noticias/nacional/sanchez-adelanta-elecciones-generales-dia-29-noviembre-necesitamos-ampliar-apoyo-gente-hacer-mas_202610056ac34d5a916cda53dca4349b.html" target="_blank">adelantar las elecciones generales</a></strong>, sobre si es un buen momento o no para la izquierda y si es posible, por ende, revalidar el actual Gobierno progresista.</p><p class="L6-event__text">"Creo que no tenía otra. Ante la constatación de que <strong>realmente no se podían aprobar unos decretos de mínimos en el tema de la vivienda</strong> y, además, de que por primera vez el de la de vivienda se metía en el debate, creo que tenía pocas opciones y pocas oportunidades", asegura Baldoví.</p><div class="L6-news__media"><div><div class="video-wrapper"><div><section class="modVideo a3mod_player" data-mod="a3mod_player" data-model="/json/video/7/2026/10/05/6ac385a1cf334000070b27d0.json" data-main-content="false" data-no-background="true"><video class="video-main lazy" title="Baldoví confía en darle la vuelta a las encuestas y asegura que Compromís construirá una candidatura valenciana abierta: &quot;Hay partido, claro que lo hay&quot;" width="546" height="306" poster="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_163.jpg?crop=1920,1076,x0,y2&width=546&height=306&optimize=low&format=webply" preload="none"><source src="https://dpvclip.lasexta.com/assets15/2026/10/05/8389C851-C86E-416B-AA64-FEA07AB591A6/640x360.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><button class="icon link-content" aria-label="Reproducir" data-mod-elem="icon"><div class="wrap-img"></div></button></section></div><picture class="L6-media__picture"><source media="(max-width: 320px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_160.jpg?crop=1920,1080,x0,y0&width=544&height=306&optimize=low&format=webply" width="544" height="306"><source media="(min-width: 394px) and (max-width: 412px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_163.jpg?crop=1920,1076,x0,y2&width=546&height=306&optimize=low&format=webply" width="546" height="306"><source media="(min-width: 321px) and (max-width: 360px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_161.jpg?crop=1920,1077,x0,y2&width=624&height=350&optimize=low&format=webply" width="624" height="350"><source media="(min-width: 361px) and (max-width: 393px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_162.jpg?crop=1920,1074,x0,y3&width=690&height=386&optimize=low&format=webply" width="690" height="386"><source media="(min-width: 413px) and (max-width: 480px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_164.jpg?crop=1920,969,x0,y56&width=864&height=436&optimize=low&format=webply" width="864" height="436"><source media="(min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 990px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_166.jpg?crop=1920,1078,x0,y1&width=1118&height=628&optimize=low&format=webply" width="1118" height="628"><source media="(min-width: 991px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_167.jpg?crop=1920,1080,x0,y0&width=1266&height=712&optimize=low&format=webply" width="1266" height="712"><source media="(min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_165.jpg?crop=1920,1080,x0,y0&width=1440&height=810&optimize=low&format=webply" width="1440" height="810"><img title="Baldoví" alt="Baldoví" width="1440" height="810" src="https://fotografias.lasexta.com/clipping/cmsimages02/2026/10/05/53FF8B91-4C36-413D-BB44-CD02622A8C6D/baldovi_165.jpg?crop=1920,1080,x0,y0&width=1440&height=810&optimize=low&format=webply" loading="lazy" class="lazy"></picture></div></div> <span class="L6-media__caption">Baldoví confía en darle la vuelta a las encuestas y asegura que Compromís construirá una candidatura valenciana abierta: "Hay partido, claro que lo hay"<span class="L6-media__footer"></span></span></div><div class="L6-event-author"><img sr